# Packed extension builds.
#
# handy.pem is the signing key: the extension ID is derived from it, so
# leaking it lets someone else publish an update that installs over Handy on
# every machine that has it. Losing it is nearly as bad — a new key means a new
# ID and a reinstall for everybody. Keep a copy somewhere safe and off git.
dist-extension/
*.pem

# Android release signing.
#
# The keystore itself lives OUTSIDE this repo (C:/college/handy-keystore) —
# this repo is public, and a signing key in git history is a signing key
# anybody can use to publish an update over yours. key.properties holds the
# passwords, so it never goes in either.
mobile/android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
